### RetroFlow: manual API requests
# Run from IntelliJ IDEA (HTTP Client, built in) or VS Code (REST Client extension).
# Start the app first: ./mvnw spring-boot:run
# Run the requests top to bottom: later requests reuse ids captured from earlier ones.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health

### Create a team → 201 (run twice → 409: team names are unique)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/teams
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Team Alpha", "members": ["Alice", "Bob"]}

> {% client.global.set("teamId", response.body.id); %}

### Get the team → 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/teams/{{teamId}}

### Create a team without members → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/teams
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Empty team", "members": []}

### Open a retrospective → 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/teams/{{teamId}}/retrospectives
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "Sprint 7 Retro", "date": "2026-10-26", "createdBy": "Alice"}

> {% client.global.set("retroId", response.body.id); %}

### Add an action item → 201 (priority is optional, default MEDIUM)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/retrospectives/{{retroId}}/action-items
Content-Type: application/json

{"content": "Fix the flaky CI job", "author": "Alice", "priority": "HIGH"}

### Open a second one while the first is OPEN → 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/teams/{{teamId}}/retrospectives
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "Sprint 8 Retro", "date": "2026-11-09", "createdBy": "Alice"}

### Close by a non-member → 403
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/retrospectives/{{retroId}}/close
Content-Type: application/json

{"closedBy": "Mallory"}

### Close by a member → 200
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/retrospectives/{{retroId}}/close
Content-Type: application/json

{"closedBy": "Bob"}

### Close again → 409
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/retrospectives/{{retroId}}/close
Content-Type: application/json

{"closedBy": "Bob"}

### Try to reopen → 409 (a closed retrospective can't be reopened)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/retrospectives/{{retroId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status": "OPEN", "updatedBy": "Bob"}

### Rename a closed retrospective → 409 (only OPEN retrospectives can be updated)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/retrospectives/{{retroId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "Sprint 7 Retro (renamed)", "updatedBy": "Bob"}

### List the team's retrospectives → 200 (newest first)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/teams/{{teamId}}/retrospectives

### Add an action item to the closed retro → 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/retrospectives/{{retroId}}/action-items
Content-Type: application/json

{"content": "Fix the flaky CI job", "author": "Alice", "priority": "HIGH"}

### List the retro's action items → 200 (both filters optional, can be combined)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/retrospectives/{{retroId}}/action-items?priority=HIGH&completed=false

### Filter with an unknown priority → 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/retrospectives/{{retroId}}/action-items?priority=URGENT

